# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Allowed <type>:
#   feat     : A new feature
#   fix      : A bug fix
#   docs     : Documentation changes
#   style    : Formatting, white-space, missing semi-colons
#   refactor : Code change that neither fixes a bug nor adds a feature
#   perf     : Performance improvement
#   test     : Adding or fixing tests
#   build    : Build configuration (Gradle, Docker) or dependencies
#   ci       : CI/CD configurations
#   chore    : Repository maintenance
#
# Allowed <scope> examples:
#   identity, profile, wisdom, widget, reflection, billing, security, config, logging
#
# Example:
#   feat(identity): implement anonymous guest token generation
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
